    "collapsible_content_eHiwXa": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_nyrCgK": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": " DETAILS",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "row_content": "<h3><strong>📦 What’s Included</strong></h3><p>• 10 handmade press-on nails</p><p>• Nail glue</p><p>• Adhesive nail tabs</p><p>• Nail file</p><p>• Wooden cuticle pusher</p><p>• Alcohol wipes</p><p>Everything you need is in the box — no follow-up order, no trip to the shop.</p><h3><strong>⏱ Wear Time</strong></h3><p>• <strong>With glue</strong> — 1–2 weeks, and often longer with careful wear</p><p>• <strong>With adhesive tabs</strong> — up to 5 days, and the set stays reusable</p><p>Hot showers, gym sessions and washing up without gloves are all quietly working against you.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Q8V9NM": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "SIZING",
            "icon": "ruler",
            "row_content": "<p>Finding your correct size ensures the most natural fit and long-lasting wear.</p><p><strong>Before placing your order</strong></p><p>Please review our Size Guide. Measure the widest point of each natural nail bed and match it to the closest width on the chart. If a nail falls between two sizes, size up — a slightly wide nail can be filed down, a narrow one can’t be stretched.</p><p><strong>Please choose carefully</strong></p><p>Because our nails are handmade and worn directly on the body, we’re not able to accept returns or exchanges for sizing — the same rule that applies to most beauty and personal care products.</p><p>Which is exactly why we’d rather you spent two minutes measuring now. Still unsure? Message us before you order — we genuinely don’t mind.</p>",
            "page": "size"
          }
        }
      },
